      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0047",
      "reading_order": 49,
      "section": "2.2.1 Mains Power Mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 490.1576629101563,
        "r": 541.5246399999997,
        "b": 449.48610136319496
      },
      "content": "Main power supplies AC power supply to rectifier of UPS, then supply DC power for inverter by rectifier,  and  then supply uninterrupted AC power for the load by inverter. At the same time, the rectifier supplies equalizing charge current and floating charge voltage for battery."
    },
